/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (Peer feedback showed that our concept was still too broad. Several groups questioned whether we were teaching users a language or helping them communicate effectively in the workplace. They also suggested narrowing our target audience and focusing more on real workplace situations, including jargon, social norms, conversations with coworkers and onboarding experiences.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
