/E (What we learned from peer feedback)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (We shifted the prototype from general language learning towards workplace communication practice. The current design focuses on realistic scenarios such as meetings, workplace small talk, asking for clarification and communicating with coworkers. We also introduced a more private practice experience through the robot, allowing users to practise without revealing their language difficulties to colleagues.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
