/S /P
/P 141 0 R
/E (Feedback raised the concern that users may not want coworkers to know they are struggling with communication. This strengthened the role of the robot as a private, low-pressure practice partner before real workplace interactions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
